===Etymology 1===
{{ja-kanjitab|あめ|yomi=k}}
{{IPAfont|⟨ame<sub>2</sub>⟩}} → *{{IPAchar|/aməɨ/}} → {{IPAchar|/ame/}}

From {{inh|ja|ojp|sort=あめ|-}}, ultimately from {{inh|ja|jpx-pro|sort=あめ|*amay}}.

Cognate with {{m|ja|天|tr=ame|pos=unbound [[apophony|apophonic]] of ''ama'', “[[sky]]”}},<ref>{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref> as in the location of [[cloud]]s where [[water]] [[precipitate]]s from.

Distinct from {{m|ja|飴||tr={{IPAfont|⟨ame<sub>1</sub>⟩}} → ame|[[candy]]}}.

